        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_63d8bac170ca426283f6695c9e773a12",
      "statement": "Extractor and Process are separate orchestrators: Extractor handles single-document extraction, classification, and batch dispatch, while Process runs a load_file -> split -> per-group extract pipeline; neither calls LLM providers directly, all model traffic goes through the LLM class.",
