      "id": "claim_c654b703bf0f413abd238d0e12eba3e0",
      "statement": "The universal content format {\"content\": str, \"images\": List[bytes], \"metadata\": {...}} is the central data contract: Extractor._map_to_universal_format normalizes loader output (universal dicts, page-dict lists, strings, legacy dicts) into it, including merging singular image keys into an images list, and extract() merges multiple sources with a '--- Document Separator ---' text join plus a combined image list.",
