      "id": "claim_4b56d7d8619540798dfc7fc155aa40fb",
      "statement": "Process.extract runs per-group extraction concurrently via asyncio.gather, resolves each group's Classification by name to obtain its extractor and contract (extraction_contract preferred over contract), sets extractor.set_skip_loading(True) because group pages are already loaded, and resets the flag in a finally block.",
