      "id": "claim_f23f7ea3b1294fd2822e030b6068a8ce",
      "statement": "Process layered classification supports extractor groups (List[List[Extractor]]) with CONSENSUS (all names equal), HIGHER_ORDER (max confidence), and CONSENSUS_WITH_THRESHOLD (agreement plus confidence >= threshold) strategies, raising ValueError if no layer resolves; ClassificationTree input instead walks the hierarchy level by level and enforces the threshold at each level.",
